	(descr "ALPS RKJXV thumbstick (RKJXV122400R: two 10 kOhm pots and a centre push), and the hall-effect and TMR drop-in sticks built to its land, per the RKJXV catalog's Drawing No. 1 (Update 2510), mounting holes viewed from the mounting side; origin at the lever. Pads 1-3 are VR1, 4-6 VR2 (circled 1-3), 7-10 the switch's a, b, c, d; MP the four legs; two unplated holes for the locating bosses. Keepouts are the drawing's prohibited wiring areas, on F.Cu. https://tech.alpsalpine.com/e/products/detail/RKJXV122400R/")
	(tags "thumbstick joystick analog stick ALPS RKJXV potentiometer push switch")
